  "tag": "face_q648",
  "purpose": "L2H-BW SAFE face successor of hdie_pc_ctrl_bw_n64 (gate FAIL band/fill, TT-189.64 macro->reg; c1f1c2c0c audit: 281 non-FF boundary contacts, 10.5 contacts/um 2c macro faces). Top ot_hbm_svc_pc_ctrl_leaf_cfg_safe_face: every port a flop (KR on native RL1 ABI, consumer lands it in the 3-slot RL1 ring as vm_kshare; pure k_v/kr_rdy captures; registered pc_fault); 23 x ot_sram_1r1w_128x64_m1_p192 (5.2 contacts/um per W/E face, same TT/FF/SS timing as the 2c family); 6 abutted R0/MX/R0/MX QUAD stacks (110.18 um) in 3 columns x 2 rows at 64.8 um pitch (31.1 um pin channels), full-width central band y133.94..190.08. 0 added edges end to end (the 831-flop collar moves to the consumer).",
